  "description": "Isso Relocation is a calm, single-column WordPress landing theme built for corporate office moving crews and logistics providers. Designed around a split first screen, clear multi-phase timelines, and structured pricing tables, it presents commercial relocation workflows with quiet authority. It includes dedicated templates for floor planning guides, move case studies, technical FAQs, and quote intake. Works without WooCommerce. WCAG AA colours; scroll effects switch off for reduced motion.",
